  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Consists of computer punchcards. Title card and the 34 text card rectos have one line, a thought about art in software, printed across the top. The unpunched colophon card is printed on verso with note, "Text is drawn from group interviews and written questionnaires conducted in 2001-2002", followed by an alphabetical list of names of the 48 computer professionals who participated, and concluding with acknowledgment to "the generosity of the Hillside Group and Janet Dykstra." The cards are held together with a 1 cm. wide orange rubber band with a quote from one of the text cards printed on it in black, "It is a living thing."</subfield>
  </datafield>
